---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Text from "@/components/fundations/elements/Text.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";

// Import family images
import Image1 from "@/images/family/IMG_2104.webp";
import Image2 from "@/images/family/IMG_3877.jpg";
import Image3 from "@/images/family/IMG_3436.jpg";
import Image4 from "@/images/family/IMG_3438.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Wrapper variant="standard" class="pt-30 pb-8 overflow-hidden lg:pt-50">
    <section>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Text Content -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 space-y-6 animate-fade-in-up">
        <Text
          tag="h1"
          variant="displayLG"
          class="text-navy-blue mb-6 font-serif"
        >
          About Sarah
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textLG"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          Welcome to my world! I'm Sarah, a passionate creator, designer, and storyteller 
          who finds inspiration in the everyday moments that make life beautiful. 
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          With a background in design and a love for authentic connections, I've spent 
          years crafting experiences that resonate with people on a personal level. 
          Whether I'm working on a new project, exploring creative solutions, or simply 
          enjoying time with family and friends, I believe in bringing intention and 
          heart to everything I do.
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          My approach is rooted in curiosity, empathy, and a commitment to continuous 
          learning. I'm fascinated by how design, technology, and human stories intersect, 
          and I'm always looking for new ways to create meaningful impact through my work.
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          When I'm not working, you'll find me exploring new places, capturing moments 
          through photography, or simply enjoying the simple pleasures of life. These 
          experiences fuel my creativity and remind me of what truly matters.
        </Text>

        <Text
          tag="h2"
          variant="displayMD"
          class="text-navy-blue mt-8 mb-4 font-serif"
        >
          My Journey
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          My professional journey has been anything but linear. I've had the privilege of 
          working with diverse teams, from startups to established companies, each experience 
          teaching me something new about collaboration, innovation, and the power of 
          thoughtful design. What connects all these experiences is my belief that great 
          work comes from understanding people deeply and designing with their needs, 
          desires, and emotions in mind.
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          Over the years, I've learned that the best solutions often emerge from the 
          intersection of different perspectives. I thrive in collaborative environments 
          where ideas can flow freely, where questions are welcomed, and where the goal 
          is always to create something that truly serves its purpose.
        </Text>

        <Text
          tag="h2"
          variant="displayMD"
          class="text-navy-blue mt-8 mb-4 font-serif"
        >
          What Drives Me
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          I'm driven by the belief that design has the power to make life better—not just 
          more beautiful, but more functional, more accessible, and more meaningful. Every 
          project I take on is an opportunity to solve a problem, tell a story, or create 
          a connection that didn't exist before.
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          I'm particularly passionate about creating experiences that feel intuitive and 
          delightful. There's something magical about the moment when a user interacts with 
          something I've designed and it just works—when the interface feels natural, the 
          flow makes sense, and the experience leaves them feeling empowered rather than 
          frustrated.
        </Text>

        <Text
          tag="h2"
          variant="displayMD"
          class="text-navy-blue mt-8 mb-4 font-serif"
        >
          Beyond Work
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          When I step away from my desk, I'm an avid photographer, a curious traveler, and 
          someone who finds joy in the small moments. Whether it's a morning walk, a 
          conversation with a friend, or discovering a new favorite coffee shop, I believe 
          these experiences enrich my perspective and inform my creative work.
        </Text>
        
        <Text
          tag="p"
          variant="textBase"
          class="text-content-gray leading-relaxed"
        >
          Family and relationships are at the core of who I am. The time I spend with loved 
          ones, the memories we create together, and the stories we share—these are the 
          things that ground me and remind me why the work I do matters. They're also a 
          constant source of inspiration, showing me the beauty in everyday moments and the 
          importance of creating spaces where people can connect authentically.
        </Text>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Images Gallery -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:top-24">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 max-w-lg mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <!-- Image 1 - Top Left, Medium Size -->
          <div class="col-span-1 animate-slide-in-right delay-100">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 group aspect-[3/4]">
              <Image
                src={Image1}
                alt="Sarah - Family moment"
                width={400}
                height={500}
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Image 2 - Top Right, Small Size -->
          <div class="col-span-1 mt-8 md:mt-12 animate-slide-in-left delay-200">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 group aspect-[4/5]">
              <Image
                src={Image2}
                alt="Sarah - Personal moment"
                width={350}
                height={400}
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Image 3 - Bottom Left, Large Size -->
          <div class="col-span-1 -mt-4 md:-mt-6 animate-slide-in-up delay-300">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 group aspect-[3/4]">
              <Image
                src={Image3}
                alt="Sarah - Special occasion"
                width={500}
                height={600}
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Image 4 - Bottom Right, Medium Size -->
          <div class="col-span-1 mt-4 md:mt-6 animate-fade-in delay-400">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 group aspect-[4/5]">
              <Image
                src={Image4}
                alt="Sarah - Cherished memory"
                width={400}
                height={450}
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Wrapper>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @keyframes fade-in-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes slide-in-right {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(-50px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes slide-in-left {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(50px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes slide-in-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(50px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fade-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .animate-fade-in-up {
    animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .animate-slide-in-right {
    animation: slide-in-right 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .animate-slide-in-left {
    animation: slide-in-left 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .animate-slide-in-up {
    animation: slide-in-up 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fade-in 1s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .delay-100 {
    animation-delay: 0.1s;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .delay-200 {
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .delay-300 {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .delay-400 {
    animation-delay: 0.4s;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive adjustments for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .animate-slide-in-right,
    .animate-slide-in-left,
    .animate-slide-in-up {
      animation-duration: 0.6s;
    }
  }
</style>

